1
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,760
Superman's close. I've been
tracking his flight path.

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:11,840
Pfft. On what? Your own satellite?

3
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,290
I was kidding. You have a satellite?

4
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,640
Here he comes.

5
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,380
First one to the building is-

6
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,780
Ugh. I really hate that guy.

7
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,680
Wait here. I got this.

8
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:48,680
No offense. You just get in the way.

9
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:51,680
Here's the plan. Green
Lantern kicks Superman's ass.

10
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,680
Tmz's got the video.

11
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,680
So, what can you do?

12
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,680
I can still see you.

13
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:41,880
The creature that attacked me
had one of those boxes you have.

14
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,780
A friend of yours, I assume?

15
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:53,680
He blew up. So I'll ask you.

16
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,680
What are these boxes for?

17
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,680
Talk while you still can.

18
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,680
Trying to.

19
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:34,680
Round two, fly boy.

20
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,880
Lantern, no!

21
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,680
Chains? You're funny.

22
00:02:56,680 --> 00:03:00,630
We won't stop him. He's pissed
off. We have to talk to him.

23
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,680
Talk to him?

24
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:27,680
Lantern, focus! You stop concentrating
and that shield breaks apart.

25
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,630
This guy's gonna kill us!

26
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,830
No, he won't. You bruise,
but you don't kill.

27
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,680
Clark.

28
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,680
You've made your point.

29
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,680
Bruce Wayne.

30
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,630
Who the hell is Bruce Wayne?

31
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,680
We think it's Alien.

32
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,680
Well, it's not Kryptonian.

33
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,630
Worth a shot.

34
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:07,680
Hey, hey, hey. What happened?
We're done fighting?

35
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:11,180
Alien is relative, by the
way. It's a big universe.

36
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,680
Let's move.

37
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:22,680
Man, what is it with you and sewers?

38
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:25,680
Someone is strategically
placing these boxes.

39
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:29,880
We have to find out who and
why before it's too late.
